# Yuztoo website — DDD + file size (strict)

- **Firebase client**: do not import anything from `lib/firebase` (Firestore, Auth, Storage,
  Functions, App Check) outside `src/features/**/services/**` and `src/lib/**`. ESLint
  `no-restricted-imports` is configured as **error**. The same applies to raw `fetch` calls to our
  backend.
- **Callables**: wrap every Cloud Function call in a named service function
  (e.g. `features/lead/services/leadEdgeService.ts`). Hooks and components call the wrapper.
- **Service shape**: always return `{ data, error }`, map raw documents to typed objects, never
  throw to the caller, never read a whole collection.
- **Content**: page copy, image `src` and `alt` belong in `features/<domain>/content/`, and SEO
  metadata in `features/<domain>/seo/<page>SeoData.ts`. Never inline them in a component.
- **No app or CRM code**: this branch must not import from the Flutter app or the CRM. Duplicate
  shared constants locally with a comment naming the source of truth.
- **File length**: respect `max-lines` in `eslint.config.js` (services/lib/content 800, pages 550,
  containers/components 450, handlers 400, rest 500). If a change would exceed the limit, split in
  the same change — never raise the ceiling.
- **Large hooks**: prefer composition (`useXFormState`, loaders, submit) over one monolithic hook.

Full detail: `docs/holy-books/DDD_HOLY_BOOK.md`.
